  "lore": "The Flash, also known as Barry Allen, is DC Comics' legendary Scarlet Speedster. After gaining access to the Speed Force through a laboratory accident, he developed incredible super speed, time travel abilities, phasing powers, and the ability to protect Central City faster than anyone alive."
